{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":108460,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793440352322,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2021,"episodeCount":12,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xUaWKzpmQPTtShJfC7q3Q8Q2ujz.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"2408711","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A chance meeting spurs Kanata Akehoshi to leave her family's farm and compete for the title of Cosmo Beauty in the solar system's most prestigious sporting event. With shadowy forces waiting in the wings, will Kanata's toughness and pluck be enough?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-04-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gYpymr708YU4uzlKdykXgFVjwtg.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gYpymr708YU4uzlKdykXgFVjwtg.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"2873387","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Kanata and Shelley's newfound friendship is about to be tested in their first official match. Other teams may be worse off than they are, however, as a loss sparks an argument that threatens to turn serious between two roommates with a troubled past.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-04-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bQC6UAGRTnTLGZ7eRYF2bwT5Sba.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bQC6UAGRTnTLGZ7eRYF2bwT5Sba.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"2873388","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the second game assignment fast approaching, Kanata invites her fellow candidates to a training camp in the mountains. As the girls hone their skills, they gain a new understanding of each other's motivations.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-04-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/on9LjxEugrsfod536hYruYL5XMy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/on9LjxEugrsfod536hYruYL5XMy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"2873389","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The second game assignment has begun, and the other candidates begin to question Eva's outstanding performance. Jeff continues to investigate behind the scenes, but the mysterious bomber still has him in their sights.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-05-02","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8Dy9P99Zv8Hy9eQqmzie7hQwz8G.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8Dy9P99Zv8Hy9eQqmzie7hQwz8G.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"2873390","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The race moves to the sea for its second day, but Eva is still far in the lead. Shelley pushes herself to catch up, but can her body take the strain? Meanwhile, Yana struggles with her divided loyalties.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-05-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":10,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/u7RSN9YjHCtNAa8XCGz2CeTvzxm.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/u7RSN9YjHCtNAa8XCGz2CeTvzxm.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"2873391","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":6,"title":{"value":"Episodio 6","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The final day of the race approaching, and Kanata is training hard, determined to beat Eva. Paglia, on the other hand, is focused on discovering Eva's secrets. When she confronts Johann with evidence, is she in for more than she bargained for?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-05-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n8pHRs1MLRrBAUj61TYnRyBZTuU.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n8pHRs1MLRrBAUj61TYnRyBZTuU.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/6"},{"id":"2873392","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":7,"title":{"value":"Episodio 7","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Yucil triggers a landslide that throws the race into confusion. Yana's doubts come to a head when she is forced to choose between her friendship with Lydia and revenge for her homeland. As stakes and tensions rise, Jeff finally makes his move.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-05-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/uEQQUq2Hn7jZJWI8bTTG46cWpPH.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uEQQUq2Hn7jZJWI8bTTG46cWpPH.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/7"},{"id":"2873393","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":8,"title":{"value":"Episodio 8","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As the footrace enters its final stretch, Kanata is closer to beating Eva than she's ever been. But does she have what it takes to overcome the final hurdle? Meanwhile, Jeff races to stop the bomb Yucil planted at the finish line.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-05-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xxBGSltgdI4CdQBoSul15CUvQDk.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xxBGSltgdI4CdQBoSul15CUvQDk.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/8"},{"id":"2873394","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"In the lull before the next game, Eva reveals her past, and Kanata and her friends resolve to resist the Control Committee. But what can they do against such a powerful enemy, and what will the Committee's next move be?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-06-06","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dVdF6EhzzwBrLZwRRA4j8IZmvka.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dVdF6EhzzwBrLZwRRA4j8IZmvka.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"2873395","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"With the end of the Grand Games in sight, Paglia returns with an enigmatic new challenger sent by the Control Committee. Will Kanata and the others be able to measure up to her in their toughest game yet?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-06-13","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/f4oCINztmjD9QkdJnvmVuhudv86.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/f4oCINztmjD9QkdJnvmVuhudv86.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/108460/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"2873396","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The next game will decide who advances to the final round! The new Eva, representing the Control Committee, is a shoo-in, but who can compete with her astounding abilities? And how far will the Committee go to make sure no one gets the chance?","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2021-06-20","language":"it-IT"},